  "body": "* Brand-new home with a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n* Approx. 259sqm of thoughtfully designed living on a 511sqm (approx.) freehold section\r\n* 6 generous bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, 2 living areas and double internal-access garage\r\n* Flexible two-bedroom granny potential with its own lounge and bathroom\r\n* Elevated position backing onto a peaceful native reserve\r\n* Designer kitchen with stone island, walk-in pantry and quality appliances\r\n* Spacious kwila deck offering seamless indoor-outdoor living\r\n* Central air conditioning, sound system, intercom and ample storage throughout\r\n\r\nPositioned on an elevated freehold site in the heart of Millwater, this beautifully crafted home enjoys a tranquil reserve backdrop, generous family spaces and a flexible floor plan designed to suit modern living. Offering privacy, versatility and quality throughout, it's a home ready to grow with your family.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor provides an ideal solution for extended families or guests, featuring two spacious bedrooms, a full bathroom and a separate living area that creates excellent granny potential. Whether used for multi-generational living, teenagers seeking their own space or visiting guests, this thoughtfully designed level offers comfort and independence.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, natural light fills the open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, creating a warm and welcoming hub for everyday life. The contemporary kitchen is beautifully appointed with quality appliances, a generous stone island and a walk-in pantry, making both entertaining and daily living effortless. A second lounge offers valuable flexibility as a media room, children's retreat or quiet space to unwind.\r\n\r\nLarge sliding doors open onto a spacious kwila deck overlooking the landscaped garden and peaceful native reserve, creating a seamless connection between indoor and outdoor living while providing a relaxing green outlook with no rear neighbours.\r\n\r\nThe master suite offers a private sanctuary complete with a walk-in wardrobe and stylish ensuite. Three further bedrooms are serviced by a modern family bathroom with a bathtub, while a dedicated study nook adds extra practicality for working from home or study.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include central air conditioning, built-in sound system, intercom, under-stair storage and a double internal-access garage with laundry area.\r\n\r\nConveniently located close to quality schools, local parks, Silverdale Shopping Centre, cafés, motorway access and Orewa Beach, this impressive home combines lifestyle, flexibility and everyday convenience in one of Millwater's most desirable locations.\r\n\r\nWhether you're upsizing, accommodating extended family or simply looking for more space, this exceptional home is ready to impress.\r\n\r\nContact Team Vinson & Amy on 022 571 7074 to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our upcoming open homes. Learn more at www.vinsonamyandco.nz",
